.claude
.smart-coding-cache
# Anchored: a bare `logs` matches at any depth and silently swallowed the
# measurement logs under .wayfinder/**/assets/*/logs/.
/logs
.DS_Store
ai.env
__pycache__
# Scratch written by a measurement arm: one absolute path to the server log the
# arm is reading. It is machine state, not a result, and it changes every run.
.last-log
